    "No direct absolute bioavailability measurement for ulipristal acetate itself is available in the evidence set.",
    "No evidence molecule contains the 11β-(4-dimethylaminophenyl) substituent, which may alter metabolism and bioavailability.",
    "First-pass metabolism and active metabolite contributions are not directly quantified for the query."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

